  "title": "INAUGURAL SCRIPPS SPORTS WOMEN’S BASKETBALL SHOWCASE HEADED TO MORTGAGE MATCHUP CENTER ON DECEMBER 16",
  "summary": "PHOENIX (August 14, 2026) – Position Sports and The E.W. Scripps Company (NASDAQ: SSP) are partnering to present the inaugural Scripps Sports Women’s Basketball Showcase, a new premier women’s college basketball event debuting on Wednesday, December 16, at Mortgage Matchup Center in Phoenix.",
